'''COME TO MY DREAM''' is the ending theme for the Korean dub of ''[[M18|Hoopa and the Clash of Ages]]''. It is performed by {{wp|Jung Joon-young}} with the Pikachu Band.

Due to the artist being {{wp|Jung Joon-young KakaoTalk chatrooms|arrested and convicted of gang rape}} in 2019, the single was pulled from digital music platforms and VOD releases of the movie were changed to use the instrumental version of the song.

